    "title": "ODNR reduces deer bag limits mid-season in EHD-affected counties - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chase Campbell ,\n1 days ago MARIETTA, Ohio (WTAP) - The Ohio Department of Natural Resources has reduced deer bag limits in several Southeast Ohio counties affected by this year’s Epizootic Hemorrhagic Disease outbreak. Starting Dec. 1, Athens, Meigs and Washington counties will have a one-deer bag limit, down from three at the start of... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
